 areer and Professional Development Center at Duke's Nicholas School of th
 e Environment and\nthe Duke Office of Community Affairs.\n\nThe purpose o
 f the Career Corps is to provide community members with the opportunity t
 o have their resume reviewed as they prepare to enter the workforce and/o
 r advance their career. Members of the OneDuke career community will\nvol
 unteer their time and expertise to be a new set of eyes on your resume
