CREATED:20260805T134007Z
DESCRIPTION:Your syllabus is more than a course policy document - it is st
 udents' first introduction to your course and a roadmap for their learnin
 g. In this interactive workshop\, you'll explore practical strategies for
  creating a syllabus that communicates expectations clearly\, supports st
 udent success\, and sets an inclusive and welcoming tone from the first d
 ay of class.\n\nWe'll share evidence-informed approaches\, syllabus resou
 rces\, and examples that you can immediately apply as you prepare for the
  semester. Leave with ideas to strengthen your syllabus and plan a meanin
 gful first day of class. Join us to start the semester strong!
DURATION:PT1H
DTSTAMP:20260805T134212Z
